{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_1000_null", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "28bf41dcd282b96f03941fb61c744081668f5785d4f375119ec0c6f2fc4605db", "ja": "{$P$}さん、失礼します。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，打扰了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4fe20dfe18444de678406ccc7a4a83300b3f324a25993db1633a1081e11cf0d3", "ja": "お、志保か、お疲れさま。何か用事か？", "zh": "哦，是志保啊，辛苦了。有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "435975c433426629f0ca8c69575b912331a0c4270066b86928eba3154e15bff1", "ja": "用事かって……忘れたんですか？\nファンレターが届いてるから、後で取りに来いって。", "zh": "你问我有什么事……忘了吗？\n粉丝来信已经送到了，让你待会儿过来拿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2b6145a77da389e60109a1963a64b848bffe2af56fb2b24727e990a07ffb3dc7", "ja": "あ！　そうだそうだ。\nええと、こっちの引き出しに……あったあった。はい。", "zh": "啊！对了对了。\n嗯……是在这边的抽屉里……找到了找到了。给。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_1005", "source_sha256": "e7ff634c45c5e88317d16d67484d2c64fe7d1702244c6e5b2663299dc543cb20", "ja": "ファンレターを渡す", "zh": "赠送粉丝来信", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2000_p", "source_sha256": "bd8028b57fe1793b826e133337b45b53685601eadf1b10bae04ff7af5ad3c7f1", "ja": "『EScape』のイベントもあったからかな？\nどっさり届いてるぞ。よかったな！", "zh": "是因为办了“EScape”的活动吗？\n寄来了好多呢。太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2001_033sih", "source_sha256": "2ea794d812943994e0556bac1c03a53fc7121d16aebf10333901b6bb4cca7971", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……あの、ここで読ませてもらっていいですか？", "zh": "谢谢您。\n……那个，我可以在这里读吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2002_p", "source_sha256": "0511e51fa9af0761b7892c1054b68a8a2b5e3ddeb4d237b578cfc3b3169a31ac", "ja": "え？　ああ、別に構わないけど……\nちょっと業務があるから、やっててもいいか？", "zh": "诶？啊，倒也没关系……\n不过我还有点工作要做，可以边做边看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2003_033sih", "source_sha256": "8f1d574f8a00b4dce7cf09231ab18299231d265405471538e0e587e1120b9762", "ja": "はい、邪魔にはなりませんから。\nじゃあ、失礼します。…………。", "zh": "嗯，不会妨碍你的。\n那我就打扰了。…………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2005_033sih", "source_sha256": "6b9885250f121050e8f7fd5f0a020388b8c14f8552ff0a522a0b8e6f7468f2c4", "ja": "……ううん。", "zh": "……不。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2006_p", "source_sha256": "5e743ee90f9966d44b9e103c4460110a2c178fb4b3811bafd334a063f4d6dfa1", "ja": "志保？　どうした？", "zh": "志保？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2007_033sih", "source_sha256": "0d883605760acb9aaa6550f409a96348516dd1f35d8841b2b0c67a9130373a8a", "ja": "あっ……ごめんなさい、邪魔しましたか？\nファンレターの内容で、考えさせられてしまって。", "zh": "啊……对不起，打扰到你了吗？\n粉丝来信的内容，让我不由得思考了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2008_p", "source_sha256": "fc44ab3ad36f1ea15928ddc2f7a2dafb0d46b2655d4ff080a1b40604bc903806", "ja": "いや、一段落したところだから大丈夫だよ。\nそれより、どこが考えさせられたんだ？", "zh": "不，我刚好告一段落，没关系。\n话说回来，是什么内容让你陷入思考了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2009_033sih", "source_sha256": "da0620f7d53a3ed4079ffdbaa0fa488633a42af15005cbdcfe16282d907f5eef", "ja": "「私は『EScape』のファンです！　メンバーも、\n曲も大好きですけど、ストーリーがとても好きで……」", "zh": "“我是《EScape》的粉丝！虽然成员和歌曲我都很喜欢，但我尤其喜欢那个故事……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2010_033sih", "source_sha256": "36960a3e0b46053f40f956f4f8189ed3ab78706f0605da292ec721d76f18b15c", "ja": "「私も、今生きているこの世界が全部夢だったら\nどうしよう！？　って、考えたことがあったんです」", "zh": "「我也曾经想过，要是自己现在生活的\n这个世界全都是一场梦的话该怎么办！？之类的问题」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2011_033sih", "source_sha256": "489022d45474e818d8ecbd99838de85e5885b6a58434591a866d45cb709993d7", "ja": "「そんな風に考えてしまうこと、ありませんか？」\n……って。", "zh": "“您有没有过像这样胡思乱想的时候呢？”\n……她这么问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2012_p", "source_sha256": "dd836a9e99ec25959c6f4a655cb9b39911c44a6c138728ee13163bfa7c8de7b1", "ja": "なるほど……確かに昔、\nそんなことを考えた気がするなぁ。", "zh": "原来如此……我以前确实好像想过这种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2013_033sih", "source_sha256": "38da34952da32426a95ec889053183dafccf65d9c2c1f06749794505e76fb200", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、どうしますか？\nこの世界が全部、夢だったら。", "zh": "{$P$}先生会怎么做呢？\n如果这个世界全都是一场梦的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2014_p", "source_sha256": "dbc6c9c8ec41d9b33b9c99a7641af3d1287ccfc2d0bbf9feaaed1cc069bc52d1", "ja": "そうだな……3人のアンドロイド達と、同じ考えかな。\n夢だろうと現実だろうと、変わらないよ。", "zh": "是啊……我和那3名安卓，想法应该是一样的吧。\n不管是梦还是现实，都不会改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2015_p", "source_sha256": "f59b873717a555f9569447b08b83a2e28441b024178341050e0f838c8203af6f", "ja": "アイドルのみんなが……志保がいてくれるから。\nプロデューサーとしては、それが全てだ。", "zh": "因为有偶像们……有志保在。\n对制作人来说，这就是全部。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2016_033sih", "source_sha256": "c45227852c0a503ba32b7cc848f7828368888adf2152c1f27d2f3783bed07cc2", "ja": "……。ふふっ、なんだか……いえ、なんでもないです。\nじゃあ、もう少し読みますね。静かにしてますから。", "zh": "……。呵呵，总觉得……不，没什么。\n那我再看一会儿书。我会保持安静的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0423_2017_p", "source_sha256": "b24ada9fa40e50f2bbbcac33b19d9613075579c633436d6b20b2aca8a1f83d43", "ja": "（笑われてしまった。ちょっとカッコつけすぎたかな？\nさて、こっちも仕事に戻るとするか……）", "zh": "（被笑了。是不是有点装酷过头了？\n好了，我也该回去工作了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
